Completed extraction per DE_Guide_v10_1.md and populated DE_Feng2024_by_codex_20251209132837.json.

Highlights
- Study: Feng2024 (bioRxiv, 2024), DOI 10.1101/2024.02.05.578943.
- Modality: Diffusion MRI with DTI metrics (FA, MD), tractography/tractometry.
- Cohorts: Pretrained on TractoInferno (N=198; 6 sites), fine‑tuned on NIMHANS CN (N=50); applied to remaining NIMHANS CN/MCI/AD (CN:123; MCI:89; AD:90).
- Analysis: Along‑tract ROI-level (100 segments/bundle). BUAN LMM used diagnosis/age/sex fixed effects; subject/scanner random effects; FDR correction.
- DNT model: ConvVAE; inputs are 3D coordinates + FA + MD at 128 points per streamline; unsupervised; transfer learning to independent cohort in India.
- Many demographics by CN-only and QC details were NR in provided text.

File updated
- DE_Feng2024_by_codex_20251209132837.json

